{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16045","headline":"原上新居十三首 六 · 王建","name":"原上新居十三首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自埽一间房，唯铺独卧牀。\n野羹溪菜滑，山纸水苔香。\n陈药初和白，新经未入黄。\n近来心力少，休读养生方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《瀛奎律髓》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/瀛奎律髓_(四庫全書本)）"}